# --- Training artifacts ---
# A git object is permanent: committing a 32-50 MB point cloud grows the clone
# size of this repository forever, for every user, even after a later delete.
# Publish models and renders through GitHub Releases / Hugging Face / Drive and
# link them from the README.
#
# The evidence needed to re-derive every table and figure in the README is kept
# instead in DOCS/assets/ (leaderboard.csv, history.csv and the two plots,
# 384 KB total), which is committed.
output/
checkpoints/
results/
submission/
submission.zip
fastgs_models/
fastgs_models.zip
*.ply
*.gif
*.mp4

